{"seq":2,"slug":"portfolio-risk","title":"组合风险管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"correlation-models","title":"相关性建模与 Copula 方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk/correlation-models","wordCount":1828,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"stress-testing","title":"压力测试与情景分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk/stress-testing","wordCount":2100,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-attribution","title":"风险归因与分解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk/risk-attribution","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"组合风险管理\">组合风险管理</h1><p>组合风险管理关注多资产投资组合层面的风险识别与控制。单一资产的风险度量需要通过相关性建模整合为组合层面的风险视图，而 Copula 方法为非线性依赖结构提供了灵活的建模工具。压力测试与情景分析则超越历史数据，通过假设极端事件来评估组合的脆弱性。风险归因将组合整体风险分解到因子、资产类别和交易层面，为风险预算和限额管理提供决策依据。</p>\n"}